@foundry_chatbot_api_HostAddress = http://localhost:3000
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Health
GET {{foundry_chatbot_api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Search the signed-in user's messages
GET {{foundry_chatbot_api_HostAddress}}/api/chat/conversations?query=example
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### List recent conversations
GET {{foundry_chatbot_api_HostAddress}}/api/chat/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json
